FAREY LADDER: THE TRUE REWRITE CARRIER
==============================================================================
ordered gap pair (i,j) at F_k:
  if i+j=k+1: (i,j) -> (i,i+j),(i+j,j)
  if i+j>k+1: (i,j) -> (i,j)
exact Farey replay orders 1..64: gap steps=26573, splits=1259, duplicate pair fibres=0
THM-841's local interval-core profile also factors through (k,i,j,lambda)
because gap length=1/(ij) and both multiplier chains are determined by i,j
