  gap (1/4,1/3), pair=(4, 3), chain code=(1,2), next=((4, 7), (7, 3))
  gap (3/5,2/3), pair=(5, 3), chain code=(1,2), next=((5, 3),)
verdict: Stern-Brocot ordered pairs are operation-congruent; tooth counts are not
the ordered pair is an exact address (no duplicate pair fibres through order 64),
not evidence for a smaller count-only compression

